  "description": "EVO PDF to HTML Library for .NET can be used in .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard applications to convert PDF pages to HTML documents.\n\nThis package is compatible with .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard 2.0 on Windows platforms.\n\nThe compatibility list includes the following .NET versions, platforms and application types:\n\n* .NET Framework 4.0 and above\n* .NET 10, 9, 8, 7, 6\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows platforms\n* Azure App Service\n* Azure Cloud Services and Azure Virtual Machines\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert PDF pages to HTML documents\n* Customize the zoom level of the generated HTML content\n* Customize the image resolution in the generated HTML documents\n* Convert PDF pages to HTML documents in memory or to HTML files in a folder\n* Support for password-protected PDF documents\n* Convert only a range of PDF pages to HTML\n* Get the number of pages in a PDF document\n* Get the PDF document title, keywords, author and description\n* Does not require Adobe Reader or other third-party tools\n\nDocumentation and code samples:\nhttps://www.evopdf.com/evopdf-pdf-to-html-dotnet",
